    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will get to choose between  mini games. Single player, co-op. Each mini game would have its own game play challenges.\u00a0\u00a0Party Brawler, Survival,  FPS shooting and more. Simple controllers. Old school no saves.\u00a0Sometimes you play against each other, other times you play as a team against the machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Party brawler: Adorable blocky characters duke it out with exaggerated square-themed weapons.\u00a0Designed for 2-4 players, it blends the charm of  tactical game play and a little of mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival game: Designed for 1-2 players. Fight waves of enemies and defeat mini bosses. Upgrade your weapons to survive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickdraw: Designed for 1-2 players. Lets see who has the quickest draw in the wild west.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FSP:\u00a0Designed for 1-4 players. Shoot things of the air. The highest score wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game5: TBA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will get to choose between  mini games. Single player, co-op. Each mini game would have its own game play challenges.\u00a0\u00a0Party Brawler, Survival,  FPS shooting and more. Simple controllers. Old school no saves.\u00a0Sometimes you play against each other, other times you play as a team against the machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Party brawler: Adorable blocky characters duke it out with exaggerated square-themed weapons.\u00a0Designed for 2-4 players, it blends the charm of  tactical game play and a little of mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival game: Designed for 1-2 players. Fight waves of enemies and defeat mini bosses. Upgrade your weapons to survive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickdraw: Designed for 1-2 players. Lets see who has the quickest draw in the wild west.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FSP:\u00a0Designed for 1-4 players. Shoot things of the air. The highest score wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game5: TBA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
